Problem Statement
Cart Management:

Cart Page: Allows users to view all items in their cart, update quantities, or remove items.
Coupons: Apply coupons which are going to fetched from local json file, maximum 1 if the amount is below $1200 . 2 coupons if it is greater than $1200.
Payment confirmation: Calculate the final amount, discount amount and show to the user , continue to place order button, display the address from user address, once click on place order, show cancel and confirm buttons. once click on confirm clear the cart.
Redux Toolkit: Use Redux Toolkit for managing the state of the cart, including additions, deletions, and updates.
 

Stretch Goals 

UI must be responsive to handle all the screen resolutions. 
Data should be store in redux store and access from store , it should be synced correctly, there shouldn't be any issues with final amount calculations
Add unit test cases for all the business logic developed in the current screen using jest. 
API Details:

Add to cart , delete cart , update cart, clear cart should be done offline. all actions should be done using redux.






